    "notes": "The two archive files (.zip) file contain the data sets used for herbarium sheets and microscopy slides segmentation experiments. Each dataset consists of a set of images (JPG). Each image is accompanied by ground truth labels (a png image) and ground truth instances (a png image).\nThe two rich text format files (rtf ) describe the structure of each archive file."
